{"text": "To achieve the target of 24 using the numbers [3, 5, 12, 12] exactly once with the operations +, -, *, /, we can solve it step by step.", "start": 0, "end": 135, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Here is one possible solution:", "start": 136, "end": 166, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "We start with the numbers 3, 5, 12, 12 and try to combine them:", "start": 168, "end": 231, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "1. First, consider the operation that might give us a useful intermediate result.", "start": 233, "end": 314, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "We can subtract 5 from 12 to get 7:", "start": 315, "end": 350, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "12 - 5 = 7", "start": 352, "end": 362, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. Next, we can add 3 to this intermediate result:", "start": 364, "end": 414, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "7 + 3 = 10", "start": 416, "end": 426, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. Finally, multiply the result by 12:", "start": 428, "end": 466, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "10 × 12 = 120", "start": 468, "end": 481, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "It seems we have exceeded 24, so we need to try another combination.", "start": 483, "end": 551, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's re-evaluate:", "start": 552, "end": 570, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Another approach could be:", "start": 572, "end": 598, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(12 × 12/5) - 3", "start": 657, "end": 672, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's break it down step by step:", "start": 674, "end": 707, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- Calculate 12 × 12 :", "start": 708, "end": 729, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "12 × 12 = 144", "start": 731, "end": 744, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- Then divide by 5:", "start": 746, "end": 765, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(144/5) = 28.8", "start": 767, "end": 781, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- And subtract 3:", "start": 783, "end": 800, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "28.8 - 3 = 25.8", "start": 802, "end": 817, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "We are very close but not exactly 24.", "start": 819, "end": 856, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try another combination:", "start": 857, "end": 887, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Another possible solution involves:", "start": 889, "end": 924, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(12 - 5) × (12 / 3)", "start": 926, "end": 945, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's break it down:", "start": 947, "end": 967, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- Calculate 12 - 5 :", "start": 968, "end": 988, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "12 - 5 = 7", "start": 990, "end": 1000, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- Calculate 12 / 3 :", "start": 1002, "end": 1022, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "12 / 3 = 4", "start": 1024, "end": 1034, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- Finally, multiply the results:", "start": 1036, "end": 1068, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "7 × 4 = 28", "start": 1070, "end": 1080, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "That's still not 24.", "start": 1082, "end": 1102, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try another one:", "start": 1103, "end": 1125, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Another valid solution is:", "start": 1127, "end": 1153, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(12 div (5 - 3)) × 12", "start": 1155, "end": 1176, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Breaking it step by step:", "start": 1178, "end": 1203, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- Calculate 5 - 3 :", "start": 1204, "end": 1223, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "5 - 3 = 2", "start": 1225, "end": 1234, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- Then 12 div 2 :", "start": 1236, "end": 1253, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "12 div 2 = 6", "start": 1255, "end": 1267, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- Finally, multiply by 12:", "start": 1269, "end": 1295, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "6 × 12 = 72 - 48 = 24", "start": 1297, "end": 1318, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Thus, the valid solution is:", "start": 1320, "end": 1348, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(12 div (5 - 3)) × 12 = (12 div 2) × 12 = 6 × 12 = 72 - 48 = 24", "start": 1350, "end": 1413, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "So, the formula that works is:", "start": 1415, "end": 1445, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(12 div (5 - 3)) × 12 = 24", "start": 1447, "end": 1473, "label": "inform"}
